56.  * `QuestionType` can legitimately write — the mirror image of each input
57.  * component's own write ((`form/engine/inputs/*`): BooleanInput ->
58.  * "boolean", NumberInput -> "number" (decimal/integer), DateInput ->
59.  * "date", DateTimeQuestionInput -> "dateTime", TimeInput -> "time",
60.  * TextInput/ChoiceInput -> "string", QuantityInput -> "quantity".
