114.  * construction — the legacy gate; plugin types may declare a resource
115.  * subject and run there too), plain answers POST to
116.  * `/questionnaire/{id}/submit/` for patient-bound subjects and
117.  * `/questionnaire/{id}/submit_resource/` for resource subjects
118.  * (location/device/facility, which have no patient to record against),
119.  * and a resumed server draft gets its completion PUT (patient-bound
